In the meantime, for more detail on
the 10 secrets of language learning,

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:37.710
and again, I'm not sure I've covered
all 10, but please subscribe to

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.620
my 10 secrets, uh, email course.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:41.670
All right, then.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:42.750
Thank you for listening.

